.th DFI I 8/12/77
.sh NAME
dfi - list files on Interdata OS/MT disc
.sh SYNOPSIS
dfi [ -l ] device [ filename ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
Lists the files on the specified device, which must contain
an Interdata OS/MT file system.

.lp +10 10
-l	Long listing - give type & size of files

.lp +10 10
filename	List only filenames which match the specified name
(may contain shell argument meta-characters
if escaped).
.it filename
must be entered in uppercase!
.i0
.sh AUTHOR
R Miller
.br
University of Wollongong
.sh "SEE ALSO"
export(I), import(I)
.sh BUGS
Doesn't know about "Dynamic OS/MT" directory format.
